* MathFn2 "## Errors" claim: two Vector operands must share one length -- [1,2] and [1,2,3]
* are rejected at evaluation time with "VectorSignalSizeMismatch { block: ..., expected: 2,
* got: 3 }" (see test_mathfn.py::test_fn2_vector_length_mismatch_rejected).
A kind=atan2 in1=B in2=C
B kind=const value=[1,2]
C kind=const value=[1,2,3]
